                                "sense_id": "285946f8-c104-3edc-8a3b-8150e65e82cf",
                                "text": "We cannot unbreed the child and reconstitute his genes in a happier combination."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad8cce47-f21c-42f1-9de9-e9679a3e80dd",
                                "sense_id": "285946f8-c104-3edc-8a3b-8150e65e82cf",
                                "text": "\"That's what they were bred for and you just can't unbreed that kind of stuff in an animal overnight,\" Ellis said."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "105c96b2-2e2e-3150-b0d2-8aa5c07f3977",
